flowchart TD
  user[Browser chat] --> vue[Vue CopilotView]
  vue --> api[POST /api/chat]
  api --> flags{ENABLE_LANGGRAPH and not ENABLE_LLM_AGENT}
  flags -->|yes, demo path| graph[discovery_graph]
  flags -->|LLM agent on| old[agents/graph.py or runtime.py]
  flags -->|both off| direct[DiscoveryService]
  graph --> intent[classify_intent]
  intent -->|general question| general[Python or optional LLM answer]
  intent -->|restaurant| history[apply_history]
  history --> filter[hard constraints]
  filter --> rank[BM25 or baseline]
  rank --> web{ENABLE_WEB_SEARCH}
  web -->|on| bing[Bing HTML sources]
  web -->|off| match[match node]
  bing --> match
  match --> answer[deterministic answer text]
  direct --> answer
  old --> answer
  answer --> cards[cards, map pins, evidence lines]
